sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Player Client
    participant API as Control Plane<br/>engine-api
    participant SR as Seat Registry
    participant ROOM as Game Room<br/>engine-net + WASM
    participant DB as SurrealDB

    P->>API: POST /v2/account/authenticate/device
    API-->>P: token + user

    P->>API: POST /matchmake/joinOrCreate/tank-3d<br/>{ name, skin }
    API->>SR: mint seat(room, TTL, options)
    SR-->>API: sessionId + reconnectionToken
    API-->>P: seat JSON<br/>sessionId, gamePort, seatToken, iceServers

    alt WebRTC available
        P->>API: wss://host/ws/signal?seat=token
        API-->>P: ICE config + SDP answer
        P->>ROOM: DataChannel connect
    else WebSocket fallback
        P->>ROOM: ws://host:gamePort/room?sessionId=...
    end

    ROOM-->>P: schema descriptor + state snapshot
    loop every tick
        P->>ROOM: sendInput / send message
        ROOM-->>P: state delta
    end
    Note over ROOM: onJoin · onMessage · onTick

    ROOM->>API: mirrored gameplay events (record_events)
    API->>DB: player_stat += 1

    opt connection dropped
        P->>API: POST /matchmake/reconnect<br/>{ reconnectionToken }
        API-->>P: same seat
    end

    opt match end / authoritative result
        ROOM->>API: POST /v2/match/{id}/result (server key)
        API->>DB: scores + counters
    end
